<title>USA: Iomega Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Iomega Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ROY, Utah 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>For fourth quarter December 31:</p>
<p>			     1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.15		    $0.08</p>
<p> Net			 20,359		    9,923</p>
<p> Revs		     397,058		  148,798</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     136,681		  127,560</p>
<p>For year ended December 31:</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.43		    $0.07</p>
<p> Net			 67,328		    8,503</p>
<p> Revs		   1,212,769		  326,225</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     133,738		  120,360</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers.)</p>
<p>NOTES: Results for fourth quarter and 1996 year include a one-time pre-tax charge of $9.1 million, or $5.6 million after tax, for the reorganization of European and U.S. operations. That translates into operating income of $0.19 per share. The First Call consensus expectation for the fourth quarter was $0.16 per share.)</p>
</text>
